.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rsop-merge-certs 1 "February 2025" "rsop 0.11.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rsop\-merge\-certs \- Merge OpenPGP Certificates
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrsop merge\-certs\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICERTS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Merge OpenPGP Certificates
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICERTS\fR]
Merge updates into the certs
